            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Human-readable label(s) for display. CDIF simplification (plain string) of DDI-CDI TextMapping.displayLabel, whose model type is LabelForDisplay. Per the cdi/cdif namespace policy a structured-string type simplified to a plain string is in the cdif namespace.</body>
